    <statement><p>Compute <m>T_2(x)</m> at <m>x = 0.8</m> for <m>y = e^{x}</m> and use a calculator to compute the error <m>|e^{x} - T_2(x)|</m> at <m>x = 1</m>.</p>
<p><m>T_2(x) =</m> <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0001"/></p>
<p><m>|e^{x} - T_2(x)|</m> = <fillin characters="20" name="AnSwEr0002"/></p>
</statement>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>e^{0.8}+e^{0.8}\mathopen{}\left(x-0.8\right)+\frac{e^{0.8}}{2}\mathopen{}\left(x-0.8\right)^{2}</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <answer>
      <p>
        <m>0.0031219</m>
      </p>
    </answer>
    <solution><me>T(x) = f(a) + \frac{f'(a)}{1!} (x-a) + \frac{f''(a)}{2!} (x-a)^2 + ... + \frac{f^n(a)}{n!} (x-a)^n</me>



<me>f'(x) = e^{x}</me>
<me>f''(x) = e^{x}</me>



So, in this case, 



<me>T_2(x) = e^{0.8}+e^{0.8}\mathopen{}\left(x-0.8\right)+\frac{e^{0.8}}{2}\mathopen{}\left(x-0.8\right)^{2}</me>



<me>|e^{x} - T_2(x)| = \left|e^{0.8}+e^{0.8}\cdot 0.2+\frac{e^{0.8}}{2}\cdot 0.04-e^{1}\right| = 0.0031219</me>


</solution>
